WEBVTT

00:05:29.919 --> 00:05:31.093
Inajalisha sana.

00:05:31.117 --> 00:05:33.617
Lakini baadhi ya vitu pia
vinabadilika kimsingi

00:05:33.641 --> 00:05:35.760
na sisi kama jamii ulimwenguni kote

00:05:35.784 --> 00:05:38.926
tunakataa tabia
zisizokubalika

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:41.299
ambazo kwa miaka mingi zimekuwa 
zikivumiliwa.

00:05:41.323 --> 00:05:43.014
Fikiri kuhusu harakati ya
MIMI PIA

00:05:43.038 --> 00:05:45.815
namna ambavyo kitengo kwa kitengo
tasnia kwa tasnia

00:05:45.839 --> 00:05:47.339
inawakamata wahalifu

00:05:47.363 --> 00:05:49.228
kuwaleta na kuwatia hatiani.

00:05:49.252 --> 00:05:51.680
Ni safari,
lakini tumeianza.

00:05:51.704 --> 00:05:53.808
Angalia kilichotokea
katika tasnia ya misaada.

00:05:53.832 --> 00:05:55.371
Baada ya matumizi mabaya ya
madaraka,

00:05:55.395 --> 00:05:57.578
tasnia ya misaada
sasa hivi inaangalia kwa makini sana

00:05:57.602 --> 00:06:00.505
Usalama wa watoto
ulimwenguni kote.